      "complete = timing.complete (the version has no steps, or every step has a segment and none was skipped; computed when the timing is made). total.best_ms, median_ms and mean_ms are over complete runs' active_ms only; null when there are none.",
      "median: the middle value of the sorted values, or floor((a + b) / 2) of the two middle ones. mean: floor(sum / n).",
      "versions keys are version numbers as strings: order them as numbers. steps: every key seen in range (a segment's step, or in skipped); the current version's keys first in its step order, then the rest by key (code point order). done = runs with a segment for the key, skipped = runs that skipped it; best, median and mean over the done segments' active_ms, from every run (complete or not). label: the key's label in the latest version that has it, else its latest segment's label. current: the key is in the current version (versions[current_version], null when timing is off).",
      "laps: per run, lap_ms = sum of its lap segments' active_ms; runs_with_laps, median and mean over the runs with at least one lap segment.",
      "paused: runs_with_pauses = runs with paused_ms > 0 (a zero-length pause doesn't count); median of their paused_ms.",
      "series: one point per timed entry, by (captured_at, entry_id); steps maps each step segment's key to its active_ms."
    ]
  }
}
